{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy this file to `sites.default.json` (same directory) to have your sites",
    "restored automatically on every fresh install of the extension.",
    "",
    "Browsers wipe an extension's storage when it is uninstalled — and loading a",
    "temporary add-on in Firefox uninstalls the previous copy — so a rebuild-and-",
    "re-add cycle would otherwise lose the list every time. On install the",
    "background script seeds an empty list from this file.",
    "",
    "sites.default.json is gitignored on purpose: it holds your own internal",
    "hostnames, which do not belong in this repository.",
    "",
    "designerHost is optional. Set it only when a site serves the Automation",
    "Designer UI on a different host than the one you browse; leave it out or",
    "empty when both live on the same host.",
    "",
    "Seeded hosts still need their browser permission granted once per install —",
    "no extension can grant itself host access. They appear in the options page",
    "with a Grant button instead of Revoke."
  ],
  "hosts": [
    { "host": "example-dev.internal.test", "designerHost": "" }
  ]
}
